# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Third-party material — present on disk, deliberately never tracked.
#
# Everything in this block is copyrighted by Fender, PreSonus or Ableton and
# is used locally as reference for interoperability work. None of it is ours
# to redistribute, so none of it enters git history.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ableton Live's own decompiled framework (.pyc trees)
Resources/control_surface/
Resources/v2/

# PreSonus Studio Pro integration assets (JS, surface XML, skins, artwork)
Resources/From Studio Pro/

# PreSonus Universal Control binaries + Motion 32 firmware image
Resources/From Universal Control/

# Firmware itself, and the Ghidra databases that embed it.
# The written analysis (*.md) IS tracked — that's our own documentation.
Resources/FirmwareAnalysis/ghidra_project/
Resources/FirmwareAnalysis/*.bin
Resources/FirmwareAnalysis/*.log

# Fender manuals — link to Fender's download page instead of redistributing
Resources/*.pdf

# Third-party remote scripts of unknown license
Resources/*.zip

# Upstream skill repo, vendored as a git clone. Link, don't embed.
Resources/AbletonLOM/

